// Dapple's calibrated silver birch bark. Each tree bakes it at these heights
// on its trunk, at its own girth there: dark and fissured at the base,
// white from a few metres up; renderers blend the stages up the stem. The
// girth and height below give the species' own set for card bakes.
(module: "birch", girth: 1.1, height: 6.0, size: 1024, stages: [0.3, 1.3, 3.0, 6.0, 10.0])
